{"chars": "The others would stay home with Blitzen, so she would never be alone. Prancer, Cupid and Donner would keep up their practice flights every evening. Evenstar, the wise old leader, would watch over the whole herd. Gentle Starbloom would keep Blitzen company in her stall. And little Lilt, who was too young for such a long journey, would stay too, which made her ears droop for only a moment, until Blitzen nuzzled her.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.413, 1.413, 1.413, 1.413, 1.413, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 1.575, 2.2, 2.3, 2.3, 2.3, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.975, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.6, 4.713, 4.713, 4.713, 4.713, 4.713, 4.713, 5.125, 5.125, 5.125, 5.125, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 6.05, 6.05, 6.05, 6.05, 6.05, 6.05, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 8.2, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 9.05, 9.1, 9.1, 9.1, 9.1, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.5, 9.5, 9.5, 9.5, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 10.225, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.975, 10.975, 10.975, 10.975, 11.075, 11.075, 11.075, 11.075, 11.075, 11.075, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 12.075, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 12.6, 13.175, 13.175, 13.175, 13.175, 13.175, 13.175, 13.325, 13